title:    How the implementation is organised
subtitle: Major directories only. Full source on GitHub.
width:    760
---
week-07-asset-inventory/
├── LAB.md              reproduction guide: the service-agent grants, snapshot, audit
├── terraform/          7 resources: feed, topic, dataset, service-agent grants
├── scripts/            validate.sh and snapshot.sh
└── docs/               figure plan, references, screenshots

# terraform/  three of the seven resources are IAM grants to Google's own
#             Cloud Asset service agent - it writes as itself, not as you.
# scripts/    snapshot.sh is separate because an export is an operation
#             with a moment attached, not a desired state.
